                "math": "P(X=0) = \\dfrac{48}{52}\\times\\dfrac{47}{51} = \\dfrac{2256}{2652} = \\dfrac{188}{221}",
                "marks": 1
              },
              {
                "do": "$X = 1$: ace then non-ace, or non-ace then ace.",
                "math": "P(X=1) = \\dfrac{4}{52}\\times\\dfrac{48}{51} + \\dfrac{48}{52}\\times\\dfrac{4}{51} = \\dfrac{384}{2652} = \\dfrac{32}{221}",
